  "releaseNotes": "First stable release for the documented Windows/Linux desktop profile. All 28 conversion directions and English printed-text OCR; section and paragraph layout, merged tables, repeating headers, long-row pagination and opt-in OCR orientation/column processing. See README for fidelity limits, native prerequisites and the required legacy JIT configuration on actual .NET Framework 4.7.2 x64. Android and macOS are outside this release's qualified scope.",
